<title>USA: Gannett in agreement to buy Army Times.</title>
<headline>Gannett in agreement to buy Army Times.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gannet Co Inc said Friday it has a preliminary agreement to buy Army Times Publishing Co.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed. The deal is expected to close by the end of the summer, Gannett said.</p>
<p>Army Times Publishing includes six weekly newspapers and one monthly publication with a combined circulation of about 360,000, Gannett said. Its publications focus on the branches of the U.S. military and federal government.</p>
